## Rule 3 — API Economy

Minimize API calls to stay within The Odds API rate limits.

- Always check the local cache (JSON file or Supabase `odds_cache` table) before
  making a new API request.
- Log the `x-requests-remaining` header after every API call.
- Configure `HIVE_SPORTS` and `HIVE_MARKETS` to limit scan scope during
  development and testing.
- Use the tiered key system (`ODDS_API_KEY`, `ODDS_API_KEY_2`, `ODDS_API_KEY_3`)
  to spread load across keys when expanding coverage.
- Never add bulk API calls (e.g., scanning all sports with all market types)
  without checking the credit cost first.

